    slug: 'cheapest-tires-sacramento',
    title: "Cheapest Tires in Sacramento That Will Not Sacrifice Quality: A Buyers Guide",
    excerpt: 'Looking for the cheapest tires in Sacramento without gambling on safety? This guide breaks down budget brands, real price ranges, and honest comparisons vs. the chains. ~158 chars.',
    category: 'TIRES',
