    id: '25',
    slug: 'tire-size-guide-what-fits-my-car',
    title: "What Size Tires Fit My Car? The Complete Tire Size Guide for Every Vehicle",
    excerpt: "Wondering what size tires fit my car? This complete guide covers sidewall codes, plus-sizing, load and speed ratings, speedometer math, and the door-jamb placard - all in plain English.",
    category: 'TIRES',
