    title: "How to Choose Aftermarket Wheels: Offset, Bolt Pattern and Fitment Explained",
    excerpt: 'Learn how to choose aftermarket wheels the right way - bolt pattern, offset, backspacing, hub bore, and load rating explained in plain shop-floor language.',
    category: 'WHEELS',
