    slug: 'brake-caliper-painting-sacramento',
    title: 'Brake Caliper Painting in Sacramento: Colors, Cost and Custom Finishing',
    excerpt: 'Brake caliper painting in Sacramento done right: high-temp paint, full prep process, color options, cost breakdown, and same-day service at Tire Geeks on Florin Rd and Arden Way.',
    category: 'BRAKES',
    author: 'Qassam Tariq',
