    title: "Classic Car Tires and Wheels in Sacramento: Restoration, Upgrades and Expert Fitment",
    excerpt: 'Shopping for classic car tires in Sacramento? We cover bias-ply vs radial, whitewall options, period-correct sizes, and retro wheel fitment for Mustangs, Camaros, and more.',
    category: 'CLASSIC CARS',
