    title: "Best Tires and Wheels for RAM 1500: The Sacramento Truck Owners Guide",
    excerpt: 'Find the best tires for RAM 1500 trucks in Sacramento - sizes, bolt patterns, leveling kit combos, and wheel fitment explained by Tire Geeks technicians.',
    category: 'VEHICLE GUIDES',
    author: 'Azam Mirza',
